<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market is closed on Friday and Saturday due to national holiday. It will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Taiwan dollar closed at T$27.559 to the U.S. dollar compared to Wednesday's T$27.586 close. Turnover through dealers was an active US$246.5 million.</p>
<p>-- James Peng (5080815)</p>
</text>
